@bg dawn_street t=slow d=2.6
@music charlie
@amb birds
@fx light n=0.5
@time 05:44
@cam reveal
> Breakfast is ten minutes away on foot. The others are half a street ahead, a loose, loud shape in the early light, and Songha is walking backwards to count them.
> You and Charlie have fallen behind on purpose. There's a bus stop. It has a bench. It was always going to happen.
@show charlie smile at=c
charlie: You like these. You told me. A window over a bus stop. You used to guess where people were going.
