you: It's okay.
charlie: I don't have the word for what we are. I looked. "Friend" is right, but it's a big word, and I've got seven of those already, and you're not an eighth of anything.
charlie[thinking]: You're my "landed." That's the word. It's a job, and a person, and a place. It's all three answers at once.
@cam closeup charlie
charlie[smile]: I love you. The kind where I save your seat for forty years and give you a look when you're late. I'm saying it plainly, because tonight I learned you can.
